  "finalText": "I cancelled the wireless mouse line (L1) on order O-2003 and refunded it to Marcus's card. The other two lines are untouched and still pending.\n\n- **Cancellation:** L1 was 2 mice. Cancelling it was the only change to the order. The hub (L2) and cables (L3) remain pending, so they ship as planned.\n- **Refund:** I refunded 7,350 cents to the original card (RF-1). That is what he actually paid for the line, because the MOUSE25 discount brought it below the list price of 2 × 4,900. The order has now refunded 7,350 of 19,950 cents.\n- **Stock:** I put the 2 mice back, so P-MOU stock went from 30 to 32. The line was pending rather than backordered, so I treated the units as set aside for this order. The inventory log had no movements to confirm that.\n\nNothing conflicted with the task or the domain rules.",
